[%# The layout for the "Harry Potter and the Request for Help" pages.

    This used to be a 70-line copy of layouts/default.tt that differed from it in the page
    heading, in appending the directory index and the copyright notice to <main>, and in
    drifting out of date (it loaded the scripts differently, and when the sidebar moved to
    <site-split-view> that is one more thing a copy would have to be kept in step with). It
    is now default.tt with those three differences passed in. -%]
[% WRAPPER layouts/default.tt heading = 'Harry Potter and the Request for Help' -%]
  [% content %]
  [% IF entries && entries.size > 0 %]
    <swc-divider size="m"></swc-divider>
    <div class="directory-index">
      [% INCLUDE partials/autoindex_list.tt entries=entries %]
    </div>
  [% END %]
  <div class="copyright">
    <span class="swc-Detail swc-Detail--sizeM">
      This is a fan fiction work based off of, but not associated with Mrs. J.K. Rowling, Warner Bros., or any of the individuals or companies associated with producing and publishing Harry Potter books and films.
      Only original content, derived ideas, new non-canonical characters and situations are copyright [% content.author || 'Luke Schierer' %].
    </span>
  </div>
[% END -%]
